sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant API as vLLM API Server<br/>(OpenAI-compatible)
    participant Plugin as vLLM Plugin System<br/>(setuptools entry points)
    participant Platform as HpuPlatform<br/>(vllm_gaudi)
    participant Worker as HPU Worker
    participant Runner as HPU Model Runner
    participant Attn as HPU Attention Backend
    participant Ops as HPU Custom Ops<br/>(FP8, MoE, Rotary)
    participant HPU as Intel Gaudi HPU
    participant HCCL as HpuCommunicator<br/>(HCCL)
    participant NIXL as NIXL KV Connector

    Note over Plugin,Platform: Plugin Registration (startup)
    Plugin->>Platform: register() — platform_plugins entry point
    Plugin->>Worker: register_utils() — general_plugins
    Plugin->>Ops: register_ops() — general_plugins
    Plugin->>Runner: register_models() — general_plugins
    Platform->>Attn: Select attention backend<br/>(Unified/MLA/V1)

    Note over Client,HPU: Inference Flow (per request)
    Client->>API: POST /v1/completions<br/>or /v1/chat/completions
    API->>Platform: Route to HPU backend
    Platform->>Worker: Schedule inference
    Worker->>Runner: Execute model forward pass
    Runner->>Ops: FP8 quantized ops
    Runner->>Attn: Attention computation
    Attn->>HPU: Execute on Gaudi device
    HPU-->>Attn: Attention result
    Attn-->>Runner: Attention output
    Runner-->>Worker: Model output
    Worker-->>Platform: Inference result
    Platform-->>API: Generated tokens
    API-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Worker,HCCL: Multi-Device (if configured)
    Worker->>HCCL: Collective operations<br/>(all-reduce, all-gather)
    HCCL->>HPU: HCCL over Gaudi interconnect
    HPU-->>HCCL: Collective result
    HCCL-->>Worker: Synchronized tensors

    Note over Worker,NIXL: Disaggregated Prefill (if configured)
    Worker->>NIXL: Transfer KV cache<br/>(prefill → decode node)
    NIXL-->>Worker: KV cache received
